org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-4h/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]tmux_ping becomes a shared-state reader with a fallback pinger[bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]tmux-ping-state[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]tmux-ping-state: rewrite tmux_ping as a fast, bugyi-free reader of [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]~/tmp/tmux_ping_state that pings only when no fresh Hammerspoon [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]heartbeat exists, render the shared health tiers in tmux markup, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]cover it with bashunit tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Pure Lua ping window model and presentation[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]ping-window-model[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]ping-window-model: add the hs-free ping_window.lua module (state [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]parse/serialize, window append and gap reset, tier classification, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]fixed-width count, RTT parsing, menu bar title and dropdown model) with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]a busted spec built on the shared contract fixtures.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Hammerspoon ping menu bar runtime, init wiring, and README[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]ping-menubar[dim] · [dim][/dim]after tmux-ping-state, ping-window-model[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]ping-menubar: add the ping_indicator.lua runtime that owns the 2 s [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]cadence, pauses while locked, claims and writes the shared state, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]renders the styled status item and lazy dropdown; wire it into init.lua [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]behind an xpcall, extend the specs, and document the feature in the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]README.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-4h","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-4h.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-0d3ba806d94ce97c2149ebdad199781b","started_at":"2026-10-05T16:00:18.994825+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"09e886fb88afc8657fba2e67449902159931f6a855492c56c91be83d51770c3f","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-4h.land/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"57e6436f5b62dde300f821a03cb77de09557a1f85e978772eb4ec1edc935380d","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-4h.land/meta.json","size_bytes":703},"prompt":{"digest":"070ce02e42a3a440668bb52d1b293959cbc49722a95033f3ca3637a30bd790ac","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-4h.land/prompt.md","size_bytes":221},"state":{"digest":"3a435af284e8eb395abdd51ce3dfa880efeda0c912e426b7b11683ca302012f4","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-4h.land/state.json","size_bytes":163}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-4h.land","local_name":"bob-cli-4h.land","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-4h","agent_clan_generation":"20261005120009","approve":true,"bead_id":"bob-cli-4h","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-4h","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.7","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub","wait_for_beads":["bob-cli-4h.1","bob-cli-4h.2","bob-cli-4h.3"]},"source_run_id":"run-4416a49f7db6ec76b6b69a4f138c720d","started_at":"20261005120012","state":"waiting"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":